Eigen 3.4.0 headers vendored for MVKit's private numerical backend.
Source provenance for this build environment: CasADi's bundled Eigen 3.4.0 header tree.
Eigen is a header-only C++ template library. No Eigen types are exposed by MVKit public headers or ABI.
Upstream: https://eigen.tuxfamily.org/
